      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The specific flashpoints include systematic harassment of commercial fishing vessels, unauthorized port calls to disputed reef areas, and repeated near-missions by military aircraft that signal an intent to assert control. These actions constitute aggressive posturing designed to test defiance limits and fragment regional security through manufactured friction. Your ministry must treat these events as immediate escalation triggers that require rapid diplomatic and operational responses to prevent full-scale confrontation.",
